        "sections": [
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>What is the value of <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x]</span> that satisfies the following equation?</p>",
            "readable_text": "What is the value of [MATH: x] that satisfies the following equation?",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^x = 3^4]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 3^x = 3^4]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We call this an <strong>exponential equation</strong> because the variable is contained within the exponent. </p>",
            "readable_text": "We call this an exponential equation because the variable is contained within the exponent.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Now, this equation is pretty easy to solve. Because the bases on both sides of the equation are the same (they are both equal to <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3]</span>), we can simply equate the powers.</p>",
            "readable_text": "Now, this equation is pretty easy to solve. Because the bases on both sides of the equation are the same (they are both equal to [MATH: 3]), we can simply equate the powers.",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^{x}|= 3^{4}; x|= 4]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "[MATH: 3^{x}|= 3^{4}; x|= 4]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Therefore, the solution to this equation is <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x=4.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Therefore, the solution to this equation is [MATH: x=4.]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
        ],
        "images": [],
        "free_entry_blanks": [],
        "select_lists": [],
        "readable_text": "Content:\nWhat is the value of [MATH: x] that satisfies the following equation?\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 3^x = 3^4]\n\nContent:\nWe call this an exponential equation because the variable is contained within the exponent.\n\nContent:\nNow, this equation is pretty easy to solve. Because the bases on both sides of the equation are the same (they are both equal to [MATH: 3]), we can simply equate the powers.\n\nContent:\n[MATH: 3^{x}|= 3^{4}; x|= 4]\n\nContent:\nTherefore, the solution to this equation is [MATH: x=4.]"
      },
