          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>First, we rewrite <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 9]</span> as <span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^2]</span> and then proceed as before:\n<span class=\"math\">[MATH: 3^{x}|= (1)/(9); 3^{x}|= (1)/(3^{2}); 3^{x}|= 3^{\u2212 2}]</span>\nSince both sides of the equation share the same base <span class=\"math\">[MATH: (3),]</span> we equate the exponents and get <span class=\"math\">[MATH: x=-2.]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "First, we rewrite [MATH: 9] as [MATH: 3^2] and then proceed as before:\n[MATH: 3^{x}|= (1)/(9); 3^{x}|= (1)/(3^{2}); 3^{x}|= 3^{\u2212 2}]\nSince both sides of the equation share the same base [MATH: (3),] we equate the exponents and get [MATH: x=-2.]",
